### Behaviour changes (decide first)

| Status | # | Lines | Change | What changes | Take |
|--------|---|-------|--------|--------------|------|
| [ ] | 28 | ~40 | Rewrite the dependency sort with one prerequisite map | Later waves run in a different order | Skip |
| [ ] | 29 | ~45 | Collapse the 5 result adapters into one `instanceof` check | Runtime type checks instead of types; conflicts with 22 | Skip |
| [ ] | 30 | ~16 | `DML.Records(...).with()`/`withRelationship()` write to records immediately | Field writes at call time instead of registration | Not in 4.1 |
| [ ] | 31 | ~25 | `EnhancedRecord` implements `Record`; delete `DmlRecord` | New `global` methods, permanent once released | Skip |
| [ ] | 32 | ~6 | Leave already-saved parents out of the dependency graph | Saves a DML statement in some cases, adds one in others | Skip |
| [ ] | 33 | ~16 | Run dependency waves through the merged orchestrator | Statement order | Skip |
| [ ] | 34 | ~8 | `null` in mock config means every object type | Meaning of `insertsFor(null)` | Skip |
